const t03=task(3,'Set up PPAP scope and the integrated part warrant','Fields and forms','Let the SIA PPAP Engineer prepare the exact facility, drawing and part scope that a supplier will confirm.','Add the target PPAP scope fields, selected-part and shipping-depot controls, and ordinary Draft form behavior. Change the two verified legacy display/due-date settings while retaining existing identity, owner, settings and originating links. Keep authoritative criticality read only and make the two part masses available for supplier entry at the permitted stage.','A scoped PPAP setup form and part-warrant fields with clear internal/supplier responsibilities.',[1,2,9,12],[['IN-02','Supply native operational Drawing Revision/Part identifiers and authoritative source/facility/depot mapping for the reference controls; known scalar and mass controls can proceed.'],['IN-06','Supply the visibility record selection and supplier actor/access connection used by these controls; no supplier may receive draft access.'],['IN-14','Supply the supported target-only display/default expression method; the required business calculation and maximum are specified in this assignment.']],{...setupRole,blockedStatus:'Partly waiting: the ordinary scalar, part-mass and local-record controls can proceed; external selectors and the replacement legacy expressions wait for the named bindings.'});
