const t07=task(7,'Set up the governed requirement library','Library configuration','Let configuration administrators maintain approved requirement content and typed questions without editing published versions.','Create requirement/question authoring and version fields and ordinary administration forms. Enter the supplied SIA requirement and question rows by stable Code, with separate content, routing, protection and attachment rules; retain the version fields for publication.','Requirement and question forms with exact authoring/version settings and source-backed initial content when received.',[1,2],[['IN-01','Supply every approved requirement Code/Name/instructions/category/routing/protection/file rule/procedure reference and question Code/prompt/type/requiredness/instructions/order. Field/form configuration can proceed; actual library entries cannot be invented.'],['IN-05','Supply the shared Supplier Management Role identifiers used by requirement Routing Role; this is a reference to the shared library, not membership on the library group.']],{...setupRole,blockedStatus:'Partly waiting: the authoring/version structures and ordinary forms can proceed; initial SIA content and route selections wait for the supplied controlled rows and library-role identifiers.'});
